      "before": "kpk1-l18-a5-e01",
      "title": {
        "en": "Stoi, leży, wisi"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Polish says how a thing is where it is. What stands up *stoi*: *lodówka stoi w kuchni*. What lies flat *leży*: *dywan leży na podłodze*. What hangs *wisi*: *obraz wisi na ścianie*. For more than one: *stoją*, *leżą*, *wiszą*. *Kwiatek* is a flower in a pot, and *telewizor* a television set."
      }
    }
  ],
